<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 16/19.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 16/19.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, May 19 on Friday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   19.05.97	  16.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5672	    6.5822</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3498	    2.3596</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5886	    4.6030</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4350	    3.4429</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5253	    0.5271</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7782	    0.7810</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2938	    0.2949</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0194	    7.0089</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6943	    0.6941</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2688	    1.2713</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
